set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A219985

T(n,k)=Unmatched value maps: number of nXk binary arrays indicating the locations of corresponding elements not equal to any horizontal, vertical or antidiagonal neighbor in a random 0..3 nXk array.

The 46 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A219985

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 2, 2, 4, 11, 4, 7, 42, 42, 7,
    12, 154, 316, 154, 12, 21, 582, 2344, 2344, 582,
    21, 37, 2199, 17591, 34212, 17591, 2199, 37, 65, 8287,
